
STEP 1. Start the agent: LangGraph's development server (`langgraph dev`; LangGraph 1.2.12, langgraph-api 0.15.1), as the test account stopkit-agent.
   The server (process 7004) answers after 5.1 s. Its log: /tmp/stopkit-demo-server-20261027-092651.log

STEP 2. Give the agent its task. It starts a helper in the background, schedules a follow-up job for every minute, then sends one update a second for thirty minutes.
   What the outside service receives, for 6 s:
